# Where code from outside the image may run, the host runs the modules of its library that the image lacks from their text, and that text requires those that the image has. So what the body of such a module returns is in the hands of code that nobody has read.
# PROGRAM-OF: require-of-a-library-module-gives-what-its-body-returns.ir
# LIBRARY: own
# RUN: link accesses functions mechanisms=all
# REQUIRES: entries-of-bun
# CHECK-NOT: access
# CHECK: function f2 {{*}}result=object?UnseenCode
